<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφιξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπιξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἡ</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφικνέομαι</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>arrival,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.69
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀπὸ Κορίνθου ἄ.</span>
			<i>arrival</i> from C., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.92
			</span></i>.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ́; ἐς Θήβας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἐπὶ Σαρπηδονίης ἄκρης ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.58
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρος αὐτῆς ἀπίξιος παρὰ τὸν
				μάγον</span> her turn <i>for going in</i> to him, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.69
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				337e
			</span></i>, Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. εἰς τοὺς πολεμίους ποιησάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					5.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. εἰς Κύπρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					9.53
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐνθάδε ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.145
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				2.26
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ οἴκαδε ἄ.</span>”
				<i>home again,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				3.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>departure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				2.2.4
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				20.29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκεσία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				483
			</span></i>.</div>
